{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028000601818-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028001728\"/><p>南亞裔電單車外賣員倒臥於路中。</p><p>元朗發生交通意外。昨日(27日)晚上10時38分，一名南亞裔電單車外賣員，駛至馬田路與教育路交界時，與一輛私家車發生碰撞，南亞裔鐵騎士人仰車翻，私家車司機報案求助。救護員到場為受傷鐵騎士作初步治理後，拒絕送院。警員正調查意外起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.389879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:06:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:36.438336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:36.438336+00:00","content_hash":"fa807265ded7adec26b38a49df478366f7d90aede3da4ca3fb7e1e8002d489d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}